---
title: Instant booking
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor G as Guest
    participant W as Website (BFF)
    participant A as Django API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Q as Outbox worker
    G->>W: Choose dates, click Reserve
    W->>A: POST /quotes
    A->>DB: read listing, calendar, policy
    A-->>W: quote (id, lines, total, expires in 30 min)
    W->>A: POST /me/bookings with quote_id and Idempotency-Key
    A->>DB: BEGIN, lock idempotency key, check open booking limits
    A->>DB: lock host wallet balance row, check floor and overdue refunds
    A->>DB: lock listing row, INSERT booking (confirmed, snapshot, check-in code)
    Note over A,DB: exclusion constraint refuses overlapping stays, trigger refuses blocked days
    A->>DB: INSERT ledger transaction (wallet debit 6,660, revenue credit 6,660)
    A->>DB: INSERT booking_event and outbox messages
    A->>DB: COMMIT
    A-->>W: 201 booking BLD-2026-..., confirmed
    W-->>G: Confirmation page, exact address and check-in code now visible
    Q->>DB: pick outbox messages (SKIP LOCKED), retry or mark dead
    Q-->>G: SMS and email to guest
    Q-->>G: notification to host members
